  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mobile money for Poor (MM4P)genomf&#xf6;rs av UNCDF (UN Capital            Devleopment Fund) f&#xf6;r att utveckla n&#xe4;sta generation av mobila         finansiella tj&#xe4;nster med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; fattiga. Syftet &#xe4;r att ge  m&#xf6;jligheter till bankliknade tj&#xe4;nster s&#xe5; som att spara och skicka     pengar eller ta emot &quot;socialabidrag&quot; via mobiltelefon.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobile money for Poor (MM4P)is a UNCDF (UN Capital Devleopment Fund)  programme to develop next generation och Fincial services,focused on  poor people. The porpose is to develop services similar to banks,     like saving and transfer money and other sevices that could be done   with mobilephones.</narrative>
